// [ssA Agency Data Requirements.note]  search in ssTEA source files for a reference to this file.
//
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Each Event managed through the Api needs a Per-Event allocation of variables in memory always
   available for access by the App, ssTEA event management, and the App's Event software itself.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   This "Agency Data" note focuses on the memory locations needed to participate in ssA Agency FSMs.
   The "Volatile Memory" note describes how to make the compiler generate memory accesses required.
   [.\SimpleSal\ssDocs\swDev\Volatile Memory.note]         sophisticated embedded software knowledge
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

